===============================================================
CHAPTER 27 — MODULAR & PROFESSIONAL C PROGRAMMING
===============================================================

This chapter moves C programming from:

    "I can write a C program"

to:

    "I can organize and build a real C project."

The syllabus covers:

27.1 Modular Programming
27.2 Header Files
27.3 Source Files
27.4 Function Organization
27.5 Separate Compilation
27.6 Static Libraries
27.7 Shared Libraries — Overview
